        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Annina Farm &quot;is a story driven horror game that tells the tragic events that occur on a farm here. When you walk into the house that used to be filled with laughter and joy, the mournful howl of evil spirits echoes in your ears, then appears and relentlessly pursues you. Placed on the desktop, letters guide you forward, hard work and strength... Explore the changes in this family - you need to have enough courage and motivation to understand their existence!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What you need to do is:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >■ Follow the instructions on the letterhead</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >■ Collect cloth dolls (playing with bears) from the map that can affect the icon in the bottom right corner</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >■ Escape from the house within 10 seconds after completing the collection is considered a successful completion of the game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >■ The game does not save, failure starts from scratch</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421610/extras/e73dac46dd2a10119e5825d543b0e9e0.avif?t=1765616590\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421610/extras_big/e73dac46dd2a10119e5825d543b0e9e0.avif?t=1765616590 width=1560 height=502 /></span></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Annina Farm &quot;is a story driven horror game that tells the tragic events that occur on a farm here. When you walk into the house that used to be filled with laughter and joy, the mournful howl of evil spirits echoes in your ears, then appears and relentlessly pursues you. Placed on the desktop, letters guide you forward, hard work and strength... Explore the changes in this family - you need to have enough courage and motivation to understand their existence!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What you need to do is:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >■ Follow the instructions on the letterhead</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >■ Collect cloth dolls (playing with bears) from the map that can affect the icon in the bottom right corner</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >■ Escape from the house within 10 seconds after completing the collection is considered a successful completion of the game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >■ The game does not save, failure starts from scratch</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421610/extras/e73dac46dd2a10119e5825d543b0e9e0.avif?t=1765616590\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421610/extras_big/e73dac46dd2a10119e5825d543b0e9e0.avif?t=1765616590 width=1560 height=502 /></span></p>",
